    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:effectivemediapresentationsettingsfor:0002:0001",
      "source": "Indicates the media presentation settings with media characteristics that are possessed by the currently selected AVMediaSelectionOption in the specified AVMediaSelectionGroup.",
